OL,3,ASeveral injured as Saudi capital
OL,4,Aairport reportedly hit again
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeveral people have been injured in an
OL,7,Fattack on an international airport in
OL,8,Fthe Saudi capital, reports say, just
OL,9,Fdays after Yemen's Houthi rebels
OL,10,Fclaimed two successful attacks on the
OL,11,Fhub.
OL,13,FKing Khalid International Airport in
OL,14,FRiyadh was evacuated after a loud blast
OL,15,Fwas heard on Saturday, two
OL,16,Finternational news agencies have
OL,17,Freported.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,318,300,200,140,0,100
